{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01QTodWuDmFVA2Ds5VGRXXss","type":"tool_result","content":"230\t    @Transactional(readOnly = true)\n231\t    public Collection<Vet> findVets() throws DataAccessException {\n232\t        return vetRepository.findAll();\n233\t    }\n234\t\n235\t    @Override\n236\t    @Transactional\n237\t    public void saveOwner(Owner owner) throws DataAccessException {\n238\t        if (owner.getTelephone() != null) {\n239\t            owner.setTelephone(normalizeTelephone(owner.getTelephone()));\n240\t        }\n241\t        if (owner.getEmail() != null) {\n242\t            owner.setEmail(normalizeEmail(owner.getEmail()));\n243\t        }\n244\t        if (owner.getRegistrationDate() == null) {\n245\t            owner.setRegistrationDate(LocalDate.now());\n246\t        }\n247\t        assertTelephoneUnique(owner, owner.getTelephone());\n248\t        ownerRepository.save(owner);\n249\t    }\n250\t\n251\t    private static String normalizeEmail(String email) {\n252\t        return email == null ? null : email.toLowerCase(Locale.ROOT);\n253\t    }\n254\t\n255\t    private static String normalizeTelephone(String telephone) {\n256\t        return telephone == null ? null : E164Telephone.toE164(telephone);\n257\t    }\n258\t\n259\t    /**\n260\t     * Rejects saving {@code owner} when its {@code normalized} telephone is already used by any\n261\t     * other owner, so no two owners can share a telephone number.\n262\t     *\n263\t     * @throws DuplicateTelephoneException if another owner already has the same normalized telephone\n264\t     */\n265\t    private void assertTelephoneUnique(Owner owner, String normalized) {\n266\t        if (normalized == null || normalized.isEmpty()) {\n267\t            return;\n268\t        }\n269\t        for (Owner existing : ownerRepository.findAll()) {\n270\t            if (!existing.getId().equals(owner.getId())\n271\t                    && normalized.equals(normalizeTelephone(